.* The menus.
:PANEL NAME=WRKJOB KEYL=WJKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Job
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOB'.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='RETURN 101' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT1'.Display job status attributes
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='RETURN 102' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT2'.Display job definition attributes
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='RETURN 103' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT3'.Display job run attributes, if active
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='RETURN 104' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT4'.Work with spooled files
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='RETURN 110' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT10'.Display job log, if active, on job queue, or pending
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='RETURN 111' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT11'.Display call stack, if active
:MENUI OPTION=12 ACTION='RETURN 112' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT12'.Work with locks, if active
:MENUI OPTION=13 ACTION='RETURN 113' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT13'.Display library list, if active
:MENUI OPTION=14 ACTION='RETURN 114' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT14'.Display open files, if active
:MENUI OPTION=15 ACTION='RETURN 115' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT15'.Display file overrides, if active
:MENUI OPTION=16 ACTION='RETURN 116' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT16'.Display commitment control status, if active
:MENUI OPTION=17 ACTION='RETURN 117' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT17'.Display communications status, if active
:MENUI OPTION=18 ACTION='RETURN 118' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT18'.Display activation groups, if active
:MENUI OPTION=19 ACTION='RETURN 119' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT19'.Display mutexes, if active
:MENUI OPTION=20 ACTION='RETURN 120' HELP='WRKJOB/OPT20'.Work with threads, if active
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPJOB KEYL=DJKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOB'.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='RETURN 101' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT1'.Display job status attributes
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='RETURN 102' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT2'.Display job definition attributes
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='RETURN 103' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT3'.Display job run attributes, if active
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='RETURN 104' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT4'.Display spooled files
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='RETURN 110' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT10'.Display job log, if active, on job queue, or pending
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='RETURN 111' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT11'.Display call stack, if active
:MENUI OPTION=12 ACTION='RETURN 112' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT12'.Display locks, if active
:MENUI OPTION=13 ACTION='RETURN 113' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT13'.Display library list, if active
:MENUI OPTION=14 ACTION='RETURN 114' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT14'.Display open files, if active
:MENUI OPTION=15 ACTION='RETURN 115' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT15'.Display file overrides, if active
:MENUI OPTION=16 ACTION='RETURN 116' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT16'.Display commitment control status, if active
:MENUI OPTION=17 ACTION='RETURN 117' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT17'.Display communications status, if active
:MENUI OPTION=18 ACTION='RETURN 118' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT18'.Display activation groups, if active
:MENUI OPTION=19 ACTION='RETURN 119' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT19'.Display mutexes, if active
:MENUI OPTION=20 ACTION='RETURN 120' HELP='DSPJOB/OPT20'.Display threads, if active
:EMENU.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 1: status attributes.
:PANEL NAME=STSA KEYL=ATTRKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job Status Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOB'.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAI VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/STATUS'.Status of job
:DATAI VAR=CURUSER USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CURUSER'.Current user profile
:DATAI VAR=IDENTITY USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/IDENTITY'.Job user identity
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=SETBY USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SETBY'.Set by
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Entered system
:DATAI VAR=ENTDATE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ENTDATE'.Date
:DATAI VAR=ENTTIME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ENTTIME'.Time
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Started
:DATAI VAR=STRDATE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/STRDATE'.Date
:DATAI VAR=STRTIME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/STRTIME'.Time
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=SBS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SBS'.Subsystem
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=SBSPOOL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SBSPOOL'.Subsystem pool ID
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=TYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/TYPE'.Type of job
:DATAI VAR=SPCENV USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SPCENV'.Special environment
:DATAI VAR=RTNCODE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RTNCODE'.Program return code
:DATAI VAR=CNTRLD USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CNTRLD'.Controlled end requested
:DATAI VAR=SYSPOOL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SYSPOOL'.System pool identifier
:DATAI VAR=CPUMS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CPUMS'.Processing unit time used, in ms
:DATAI VAR=AUXIO USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/AUXIO'.Auxiliary I/O requests of the job
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 2: definition attributes.
:PANEL NAME=DFNA KEYL=ATTRKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job Definition Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOB'.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAI VAR=JOBD USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOBD'.Job description
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=JOBDLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOBDLIB'.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=JOBQ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOBQ'.Job queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=JOBQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOBQLIB'.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=JOBPTY USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOBPTY'.Job priority (on job queue)
:DATAI VAR=OUTPTY USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OUTPTY'.Output priority (on output queue)
:DATAI VAR=ENDSEV USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ENDSEV'.End severity
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Message logging
:DATAI VAR=LOGLVL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LOGLVL'.Level
:DATAI VAR=LOGSEV USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LOGSEV'.Severity
:DATAI VAR=LOGTXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LOGTXT'.Text
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=LOGCLPGM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LOGCLPGM'.Log CL program commands
:DATAI VAR=LOGOUT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LOGOUT'.Job log output
:DATAI VAR=PRTDEV USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRTDEV'.Printer device
:DATAI VAR=OUTQ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OUTQ'.Default output queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=OUTQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OUTQLIB'.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=PRTTXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRTTXT'.Printer text
:DATAI VAR=DATFMT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DATFMT'.Date format
:DATAI VAR=DATSEP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DATSEP'.Date separator
:DATAI VAR=TIMSEP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/TIMSEP'.Time separator
:DATAI VAR=DECFMT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DECFMT'.Decimal format
:DATAI VAR=SWS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SWS'.Job switches
:DATAI VAR=INQMSG USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/INQMSG'.Inquiry message reply
:DATAI VAR=BRKMSG USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/BRKMSG'.Break message handling
:DATAI VAR=STSMSG USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/STSMSG'.Status message
:DATAI VAR=DEVRCY USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DEVRCY'.Device recovery action
:DATAI VAR=CCSID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CCSID'.Coded character set identifier
:DATAI VAR=DFTCCSID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DFTCCSID'.Default coded character set identifier
:DATAI VAR=LANGID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LANGID'.Language identifier
:DATAI VAR=CNTRYID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CNTRYID'.Country or region identifier
:DATAI VAR=SRTSEQ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SRTSEQ'.Sort sequence
:DATAI VAR=MSGQMX USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MSGQMX'.Job message queue maximum size
:DATAI VAR=MSGQFL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MSGQFL'.Job message queue full action
:DATAI VAR=ALWMLT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ALWMLT'.Allow multiple threads
:DATAI VAR=SPLFACN USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SPLFACN'.Spooled file action
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 3: run attributes.
:PANEL NAME=RUNA KEYL=ATTRKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job Run Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOB'.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAI VAR=RUNPTY USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RUNPTY'.Run priority
:DATAI VAR=TIMESLICE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/TIMESLICE'.Time slice in milliseconds
:DATAI VAR=PURGE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PURGE'.Eligible for purge
:DATAI VAR=DFTWAIT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DFTWAIT'.Default wait time in seconds
:DATAI VAR=CPUTIME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CPUTIME'.Maximum CPU time in milliseconds
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=CPUUSED USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CPUUSED'.CPU time used
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=MAXTMP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MAXTMP'.Maximum temporary storage in megabytes
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=TMPUSED USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/TMPUSED'.Temporary storage used
:DATAI VAR=TMPPEAK USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/TMPPEAK'.Peak temporary storage used
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=MAXTHD USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MAXTHD'.Maximum threads
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=THREADS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/THREADS'.Threads
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Thread resources affinity
:DATAI VAR=AFFGRP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/AFFGRP'.Group
:DATAI VAR=AFFLVL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/AFFLVL'.Level
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=RSCAFF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCAFF'.Resources affinity group
.* Not shown: it sets the colon column.
:DATAI VAR=CPUTHD USAGE=OUTPUT DISPLAY=NO.Maximum processing unit time per thread
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 4: the job's spooled files.
:PANEL NAME=SPLF KEYL=SPLFKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1'.Work with Job Spooled Files
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOB'.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=SPLF.(No spooled output files)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD ?SNDNETSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)' HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS'.1=Send
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGSPLFA FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)' HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ENTER='CMD HLDSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)' HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS'.3=Hold
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD DLTSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)' HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)' HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='CMD RLSSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)' HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS'.6=Release
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 7' HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS'.7=Messages
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD WRKSPLFA FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)' HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS'.8=Attributes
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 9' HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS'.9=Work with printing status
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='SPLF/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=FILE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/FILE'.File
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVQ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DEVQ'.Device or Queue
:LISTCOL VAR=USRDTA USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/USRDTA'.User Data
:LISTCOL VAR=SPLSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SPLSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=PAGES USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PAGES'.Total Pages
:LISTCOL VAR=CURPAGE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CURPAGE'.Current Page
:LISTCOL VAR=COPIES USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/COPIES'.Copies
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters for options 1, 2, 3 or command
:EPANEL.
.* Option 10 and DSPJOBLOG: the job log.
:PANEL NAME=JOBLOG KEYL=LOGKEYS HELP=JOBLOG ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job Log
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAC.&JOBHDR.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=MSGS.
:LISTCOL VAR=MSGLINE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MSGLINE'.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=JOBLOGALL KEYL=ALLKEYS HELP=JOBLOG ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display All Messages
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAC.&JOBHDR.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=MSGS.
:LISTCOL VAR=MSGLINE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MSGLINE'.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 11: the call stack.
:PANEL NAME=CALLSTK KEYL=STKKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display Call Stack
:DATA DEPTH=3 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOB'.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:DATAI VAR=THREAD USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/THREAD'.Thread
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=STACK MAXHEAD=2.
:LISTCOL VAR=RQSLVL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RQSLVL'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGM'.Program
:LISTCOL VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMLIB'.
:LISTCOL VAR=STMT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/STMT'.Statement
:LISTCOL VAR=PROC USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PROC'.Procedure
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 13: the library list.
:PANEL NAME=LIBL KEYL=LIBLKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display Library List
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOB'.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LIBL.
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPLIB LIB(&LIB.)' HELP='LIBL/OPTIONS'.5=Display objects in library
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='LIBL/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LIB'.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=LIBTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LIBTYPE'.Type
:LISTGRP.ASP
:LISTCOL VAR=ASPDEV USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ASPDEV'.Device
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTCOL VAR=LIBTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LIBTEXT'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 14: the open files.
:PANEL NAME=OPNF KEYL=OPNFKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1'.Display Open Files
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATAC.&JOBHDR.
:DATAI VAR=ODPS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ODPS'.Number of open data paths
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OPNF.
:LISTCOL VAR=OFILE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OFILE'.File
:LISTCOL VAR=OLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OLIB'.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=OMBR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OMBR'.Member/ Device
:LISTCOL VAR=OSCOPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OSCOPE'.Scope
:LISTCOL VAR=OACTGRP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OACTGRP'.Activation Group
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKJOB.Job - Help
:P.One job: who it is, how it was defined and how it runs, its
spooled files, its job log, its call stack, its library list and the
files it has open. Type an option number and press Enter.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=JOBLOG.Job log - Help
:P.The messages the job has logged, oldest first. A request typed at
a command line shows with the marks before it. F10 shows every
message, the detailed ones included.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/WJKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/JOB'.Job
:P.The job, by name, user and number. A job name alone is enough when
only one job has it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKJOB/OPT1'.Display job status attributes
:P.Option 1. Display job status attributes.
:EHELP.
