:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKJOB/OPT18'.Display activation groups, if active
:P.Option 18. Display activation groups, if active.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKJOB/OPT19'.Display mutexes, if active
:P.Option 19. Display mutexes, if active.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKJOB/OPT20'.Work with threads, if active
:P.Option 20. Work with threads, if active.
:EHELP.
