:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F16=Job menu
:PD.Job menu.
:PT.F17=Top
:PD.Moves to the top of the list.
:PT.F18=Bottom
:PD.Moves to the bottom of the list.
:PT.F24=More keys
:PD.Shows the other function keys of the display.
:PT.F17=Top
:PD.Moves to the top of the list.
:PT.F18=Bottom
:PD.Moves to the bottom of the list.
:EPARML.
